+### Placeholder
+
+This is where the backstory goes: how the story began, what you read and saw along the way, who helped, and what you left out.
+
+Each scene can use any layout (`reading`, `split`, `overlay` or `full`), just as in the main story, and a scene can hold media as well as text.
+
+*Edit this file, or add new files and list them as steps in `backstory.yaml`.*
